        },
        "text_zpm8Yq": {
          "settings": {
            "alignment": "left",
            "background": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "button_label": "LEARN MORE",
            "button_style": "button--primary",
            "heading_size": "regular",
            "link": "shopify://pages/family-legacy",
            "mobile_alignment": "same_as_desktop",
            "mobile_heading_size": "same_as_desktop",
            "mobile_text": "<p>The Stevensons have been working in the woollen industry for well over a century. It started with Herbert Stevenson who used to run a woollen mill producing his own brand of Scottish tweeds on the outskirts of Edinburgh. When Drummond joined the firm, their brand of Macnab tweeds was sold throughout Europe and the US. Peter then added cashmere to the mix. Peter first went up to Inner Mongolia over 40 years ago and the Stevensons have been working with the same cashmere partners up there ever since.</p>",
            "mobile_title": "FAMILY LEGACY",
            "text": "<p><strong>FAMILY LEGACY</strong></p><p>For over a century, the Stevenson family has been at the heart of the woollen industry. </p><p>It began with Herbert Stevenson and his mill on the outskirts of Edinburgh, crafting his own distinctive brand of Scottish tweeds. The legacy grew with Drummond Stevenson, whose Macnab tweeds found acclaim across Europe and the United States.</p><p>A pivotal chapter began over 40 years ago when Peter Stevenson journeyed to Inner Mongolia, forging partnerships to introduce the world's finest cashmere into the family's craft.</p><p>Today, that same spirit of innovation and dedication to quality continues. Now based in Hong Kong, we still work with those very same trusted partners, blending a century of heritage with a modern vision to create heirloom-quality machine-washable knits. We are proud to make the timeless pieces your children will love now, and your grandchildren will treasure later.</p>",
            "text_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "title": "",
            "vertical_position": "center"
          },
          "type": "text"
        }
      },
